      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA HANDLE IT (1) shapes well for this on his dynamic win a few runs back, getting around The Gardens over 400m in 22.72 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Can measure up on top win three back. CAWBOURNE OZZY (7) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 1.3 lengths, (29.68) at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can measure up. TENACIOUS TALKER (5) is a well performed dog and winner of 15 races who was in the minor money last time out at Gunnedah (30.54). Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Speedy beginner who can find the front with a clean break from the middle of the draw. Hard to beat again. BILLY RAY'S GIRL (2) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
